&CONTROL
 calculation='scf', prefix='catio3', pseudo_dir='${PROJECT_ROOT}/.tools/pseudo',
 outdir='./scratch', tprnfor=.true., tstress=.true., disk_io='low'
/
&SYSTEM
 ibrav=1, A=3.89, nat=5, ntyp=3,
 ecutwfc=60, ecutrho=600, occupations='fixed', input_dft='PBE'
/
&ELECTRONS
 conv_thr=1.0d-9, electron_maxstep=100, mixing_beta=0.3
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
Ca 40.078 Ca.pbe-spn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF
Ti 47.867 Ti.pbe-spn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF
O 15.999 O.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
Ca 0.0 0.0 0.0
Ti 0.5 0.5 0.5
O 0.5 0.5 0.0
O 0.5 0.0 0.5
O 0.0 0.5 0.5
K_POINTS automatic
4 4 4 0 0 0
